## 題庫內容聲明 / Question-bank content notice

本 LICENSE 僅涵蓋**程式碼**。`demo/` 內的示範題庫見 `demo/README`：為已公開之歷屆
考選資源題幹，搭配獨立重寫之詳解，以及明確標示的合成展示資料。若你匯入自己的題庫，
你必須自行確保擁有使用與散布該內容的權利。

This LICENSE covers the **source code** only. The sample question bank in
`demo/` is described in `demo/README` — publicly available past-exam stems with
independently rewritten explanations, plus clearly labeled synthetic demo data.
If you import your own question bank, you are responsible for ensuring you have
the right to use and distribute that content.
